## Migrating from `pgbouncer_exporter`

Every series the upstream exporter emits, and what it becomes here. With
`emit: [otel, prometheus]` the upstream names keep working unchanged, in a
separate instrumentation scope you can drop with one `filter` processor once
you have cut over.

| Upstream series | Becomes | Disposition |
| --- | --- | --- |
{%- for metric in ctx.metrics %}
{%- set prom = metric.annotations.prometheus %}
{%- if prom.series %}
{%- for series in prom.series %}
| `{{ series.name }}` | `{{ metric.name }}`{% if series.when %}{% for key, value in series.when | items %} `{{ key }}={{ value }}`{% endfor %}{% endif %} | {{ prom.disposition }} |
{%- endfor %}
{%- else %}
| — | `{{ metric.name }}` | {{ prom.disposition }} |
{%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}

